# Build context hygiene for the root Dockerfile. Host-built artifacts must never enter the image build: a Windows
# node_modules or a stale target/ would overwrite what the container builds itself.
**/.git
.git
.github
.claude
.idea
.vscode

# Built outputs and dependencies
**/node_modules
**/target
**/target-*
**/dist
**/dist-mock
**/dist-embed
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/*.log

# Evidence packs, local environment files, planning material, deployment and tooling folders
evidence
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
docs
design
deploy
tools
tests
